    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WF-05 Candidate Outreach Sender\n\n**Trigger:** Every 20 minutes\n\n**Flow:**\n1. Check `OUTREACH_ENABLED` and Window hours (e.g. 08:30 - 18:30, Monday-Friday)\n2. Check max daily sends (from EVENTS sheet)\n3. Pick exactly ONE contact in `READY_TO_SEND` state (to spread them out)\n4. Fetch Hotel data and PDFs from Drive\n5. If `DRY_RUN=true`, skip actual Gmail sending\n6. Send via Gmail with 2 PDF attachments\n7. Log to EVENTS sheet\n8. Update CONTACT and HOTEL status to `SENT`",
        "width": 380,
        "height": 300
      },
